-- SEMICOLON ---------------------------------------------------- main.kl  K0904

Kalam doesn't use semicolons: a statement ends at the end of its line.

2│     var sum = 0;
                  ^

Help: Delete the `;` (or `؛`). If two statements share the line, put the second one on its own line. `kalam fix` does both.

Learn more: kalam explain K0904
